  "How big the interface and the posters on the browse pages are.": "Seberapa besar antarmuka dan poster di halaman penjelajahan.",
  "How much of a streamed film is kept on the device around what is playing. More ahead rides out a swarm that slows down, and more behind lets you rewind without fetching it again. Both shrink when the device is short of space.": "Seberapa banyak film yang di-streaming disimpan di perangkat di sekitar bagian yang sedang diputar. Lebih banyak di depan menahan swarm yang melambat; lebih banyak di belakang berarti mundur tanpa perlu mengambil ulang. Keduanya dipangkas agar muat saat ruang perangkat menipis.",
  "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, channels, television, playlist": "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, saluran, televisi, TV, daftar putar, playlist",
