  "Rides the volume for you, so the quiet lines come up and the loud scenes stop making you reach for the remote. Every film starts with this, and the player's own Audio panel changes only the film you are watching.": "Mengatur volume untukmu, sehingga kalimat pelan terangkat dan adegan keras berhenti membuatmu meraih remote. Inilah awal setiap film — panel Audio di pemutar hanya mengubah film yang sedang kamu tonton.",
