  "What you have watched, how far you got, favourites, the watchlist and starred channels.": "Apa yang sudah kamu tonton, sampai mana, favorit, daftar tonton, dan saluran berbintang.",
  "Whatever the disk allows": "Sebanyak yang diizinkan disk",
  "Whatever you play is listed here, with how far you got.": "Semua yang Anda putar tercantum di sini, beserta sampai mana Anda menonton.",
  "Where downloads go": "Ke mana unduhan disimpan",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Ke mana film dan episode ditulis. Torrent yang sudah diunduh tetap di tempatnya.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Di mana menyimpan unduhan",
  "Whether a film is downloaded whole and kept, or streamed through a small buffer that is deleted when you stop.": "Apakah film diunduh utuh dan disimpan, atau di-streaming lewat buffer kecil yang dihapus saat kamu berhenti.",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to. A plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Ke drive mana film dan episode ditulis — flash disk yang dicolok biasanya memuat jauh lebih banyak daripada boks itu sendiri. Mencopot aplikasi tetap menghapusnya. Torrent yang sudah diunduh tetap di tempatnya.",
  "While a film is playing. Choose one, then press the key you want it on. Backspace removes it, and Escape leaves it as it was.": "Saat film sedang diputar. Pilih satu tindakan, lalu tekan tombol yang Anda inginkan — Backspace menghapusnya, Escape membiarkannya seperti semula.",
  "Who's watching?": "Siapa yang menonton?",
  "Windows can't tie torrents to one connection. Most VPN apps have a kill switch of their own that does the same job — turn that on.": "Windows tidak bisa mengikat torrent ke satu koneksi. Sebagian besar aplikasi VPN punya kill switch sendiri yang melakukan hal yang sama — aktifkan itu.",
  "Without a code, anything on this network can play a film on this screen. That is fine at home, but worth switching back on anywhere else.": "Tanpa kode, apa pun di jaringan ini bisa memutar film di layar ini — aman di rumah, layak dinyalakan lagi di tempat lain.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels slow, most of all on a television or a set-top box, whose graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Layak dinyalakan di mana pun aplikasi terasa berat — terutama di televisi atau set-top box, di mana cip grafisnya hanya sebagian kecil dari milik laptop.",
