  "You're offline, so Ventic is showing what's on this device. Downloads play, with the subtitles they were downloaded with.": "Anda sedang offline, jadi Ventic menampilkan apa yang ada di perangkat ini. Unduhan bisa diputar dengan subtitle yang ikut diunduh bersamanya.",
